    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nariyumviriye kuri ivyo vyose nsanga umugororotsi n’umunyabwenge bompi n’ivyo bakora vyose biri mu kuboko kw’Imana, ariko nta n’umwe azi nimba urukundo canke urwanko bimurindiriye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iherezo ni rimwe kuri bose, umugororotsi n’umunyakibi, abeza n’ababi, uwuhumanye n’uwudahumanye, abatanga ibimazi n’abatabitanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iki ni ikibi kiri mu bintu vyose bibera musi y’izuba: bose bafise iherezo rimwe. Vyongeye, imitima y’abantu yuzuye ibibi kandi mu mitima yabo huzuye ubusazi mu gihe bakiriho, maze iherezo bagahamvya abapfuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu wese akiri muzima afise ivyizigiro, kandi imbwa nzima iruta intambwe ipfuye!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genda, urye ivyokurya vyawe unezerewe, kandi unywe umuvinyu wawe n’umutima unezerewe, kuko ari ubu nyene Imana inezererwa ivyo ukora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wame wambaye impuzu zera, kandi wisige amavuta ku mutwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nezererwa ubuzima hamwe n’umugore wawe ukunda, imisi yose y’ubu buzima butoya Imana yaguhaye musi y’izuba. Kuko ivyo ari vyo mugabane wawe mu buzima no mu butame bwawe musi y’izuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibintu vyose amaboko yawe ahawe gukora, ubikore n’inkomezi zawe zose, kuko mu mva, iyo uzoja, ata gukora canke imigambi, kumenya canke ubwenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hari ikindi nabonye musi y’izuba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyongeye, nta muntu azi igihe isaha yiwe izoshikira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nabonye musi y’izuba akandi karorero k’ubwenge kantangaje: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera hariho igisagara kimwe kandi gitoya, carimwo abantu bakeya. Maze giterwa n’umwami akomeye, aragikikuza akirundira ibigunguzi vyo kwuririrako ngo agitere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muri ico gisagara harimwo umuntu w’umukene ariko w’umunyabwenge, maze akirisha igihugu ubwenge bwiwe. Ariko nta n’umwe yasubiye kwibuka uwo mukene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ndavuga nti: “Ubwenge buruta inkomezi.” Ariko bwa bwenge bwa wa mukene bwarakengerewe, kandi amajambo yiwe ntiyasubiye kwibukwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
